 r←commandRequestBody cmdObj;hasRef;comp;reqbody;propnames;values
 hasRef←{(2=⍵.⎕NC'⍙⍙36⍙ref')∨2=⍵.(⍎⊃⎕NL ¯9).schema.⎕NC'⍙⍙36⍙ref'}cmdObj.requestBody.content ⍝ Can ref be anywhere else
 :If hasRef
     comp←getComponent cmdObj.requestBody.content
     r←(2⊃⎕RSI).⎕NEW comp
 :Else
     reqbody←(2⊃⎕RSI).⎕NS ⍬
     (propnames values)←{(⊂p),⊂defaultValue¨⍵⍎¨p←⍵.⎕NL ¯9}cmdObj.requestBody.content.⍙application⍙47⍙json.schema.properties
     reqbody{⍺.{⍎⍺,'←⍵'}/⍵}¨↓propnames,⍪values
     r←reqbody
 :EndIf
